<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kimberly Clark Mexico.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kimberly Clark Mexico.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co on Friday said it started coverage of Kimberly Clark de Mexico SA de CV with a rating of market perform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;This company stands out as one of Mexico's premier companies with access to some of the highest-quality consumer products in the world, an exceptional management team, a bulletproof balance sheet and a market dominance in tissue, diaper and feminine protection products,&quot; Oppenheimer said in a report.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
